# Zope Page Templates (.pt) are XML using tal:/metal:/i18n: namespaced
# attributes - Prettier has no parser for this syntax. VS Code has no
# built-in language for .pt, so Prettier falls back to whatever language
# mode the editor guesses (often Angular), which then chokes on legitimate
# ZPT markup. Format these with the redhat.vscode-xml extension instead
# (see .vscode/settings.json).
*.pt
